WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.059 line:82% position:50% size:92%
Ask what the response proves. Detection means noticing

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:05.679 line:82% position:50% size:92%
that sound is present or absent. A child

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:07.819 line:82% position:50% size:92%
dropping a block when a bell rings demonstrates

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.819 line:82% position:50% size:92%
awareness, without having to name the sound. Discrimination

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.559 line:82% position:50% size:92%
means judging whether sounds are the same or

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:17.139 line:82% position:50% size:92%
different. Identification means specifying which sound was heard,

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:21.359 line:82% position:50% size:92%
perhaps by pointing, repeating, or writing. Comprehension adds

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:25.419 line:82% position:50% size:92%
meaning. Recognizing a doorbell is identification; understanding that

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.799 line:82% position:50% size:92%
somebody may be waiting outside uses the meaning

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.959 line:82% position:50% size:92%
of that event. Similarly, repeating a direction does

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.259 line:82% position:50% size:92%
not by itself prove that the child understands

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:36.419 line:82% position:50% size:92%
it. Following a novel meaningful direction provides stronger

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:39.439 line:82% position:50% size:92%
evidence. The hierarchy guides training, but it is

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:41.559 line:82% position:50% size:92%
not a rigid schedule. A child may work

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:43.339 line:82% position:50% size:92%
on more than one level or return to

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:46.319 line:82% position:50% size:92%
an earlier skill. Always consider the actual task,

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.719 line:82% position:50% size:92%
rather than the game title. Picture selection and

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:50.819 line:82% position:50% size:92%
a hand raise can look equally simple while

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.659 line:82% position:50% size:92%
demanding different auditory skills.
